WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.635
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.303
This is ''Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.671
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.708
President Biden on Saturday
visited Los Angeles,

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:11.310
where his motorcade reportedly
caused traffic delays.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.946
Oh, come on,
it's Los Angeles.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:15.614
That's like saying
he visited New York

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.450
and caused subway delays.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.887
No, he didn't. Just happens.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:22.789
During the National
Prayer Breakfast last week,

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.958
President Biden and
House Speaker Mike Johnson

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:28.428
appeared to cry during singer
Andrea Bocelli's rendition

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:29.662
of "Amazing Grace" -- Biden

00:00:29.728 --> 00:00:31.664
because he was moved
by the performance,

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.434
and Johnson because Andrea
is a girl's name.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.702
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.772
At a rally yesterday in Nevada,
President Biden criticized

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.608
former President Trump's
economic record

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.377
and called him, quote,
Donald "Herbert Hoover" Trump,

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:46.379
a comment that has
Trump supporters

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.981 align:start size:81% position:19%
frantically Googling
"Herbert Hoover."

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:52.719
And Biden supporters.
Come on, who are we kidding?

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:55.355
I don't know
what that means either.

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:57.557
During an interview yesterday,
former President Trump

00:00:57.623 --> 00:01:00.192
discussed his criteria
for selecting a vice president

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:02.161
and said, "It's got to be

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.496
who is going to be
a good president.

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.398
You always have
to think about that."

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.435
Yeah, we know, dude.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.403
I love it when he's
the last person on earth

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:12.605
to figure something out,

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.173
and then he wants
to explain it to us.

00:01:14.239 --> 00:01:16.542
It's like having
a kid in school.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.778
"Dad, did you know there are
three kinds of rocks?"

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:22.848
"Yeah, everybody knows that."
"Well, then name 'em, Dad."

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:25.384
"I don't know the names!

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:28.187
I just know
there are three kinds!

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:31.958
And I know nothing about
Herbert Hoover, so don't ask!"

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:34.026
After several right-wing
media personalities

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:36.295
began to claim recently
that Taylor Swift

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.764
is part of a Pentagon
operation to influence

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:40.399
the presidential election,

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:43.069
a Defense Department
spokesperson said,

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:46.839
"We know all too well the
dangers of conspiracy theories.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.342
So, to set the record straight,
Taylor Swift is not

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:53.079
part of a DoD psychological
operation, period."

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.247
Because if there's one thing

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:55.748
that will sway
conspiracy theorists,

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.184
it's an official statement
from the Pentagon.

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.519
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:03.490
New York Mayor Adams last week
announced a new strategy

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.759
for the city's sanitation system
that will store trash bags,

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.528
instead of piling them up
on the street to be picked up.

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:11.598
It's part of his plan
to bring New York City

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.832
all the way in to the 1990s.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:16.035
Adams also announced

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.870
the finalized rules
for outdoor dining

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:19.772
and said, "We're
fundamentally transforming

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.908
what it feels like
to be outside New York."

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:24.410
Good, because no one here
can afford to be inside.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.546
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:28.080
A Florida man was arrested
recently

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:31.317
after he allegedly entered
a church thrift store naked --

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.686
naked -- and stole a T-shirt.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:37.423
He's being charged
with also not stealing pants.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.325
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:42.094
In honor of Valentine's Day,
Popeyes is offering

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.630
limited-edition heart-shaped
strawberry biscuits

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:46.031
with a drizzle of icing,

00:02:46.098 --> 00:02:48.834
after which your heart
will no longer be heart-shaped.

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:50.302
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:54.073
And finally, crew members
of a floating sauna in Oslo

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.309
recently rescued two passengers
from a car

00:02:57.376 --> 00:02:59.779
that accidentally
drove into a fjord.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.814
For more stories like this,
pick up a copy

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:04.350
of "Mad Libs:
Norwegian Edition."

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.718
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.453
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

